      <h2 class="serif">William Tyndale — Ellen White's Testimony</h2>
      <p>William Tyndale stands in the battle line of Protestant reformers who defied priestcraft, broke the chains of spiritual tyranny, and labored to place the Word of God into the hands of the common people.</p>
