          <div class="sq sq-dark" style="margin:0"><p style="font-size:0.9rem;"><strong style="color:var(--amber);">Religious Liberty in Action</strong> — true liberty lives where the Scriptures are free and dies where church power binds the soul.</p></div>
        </div>

